{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final part in the 'Cold Verdict' trilogy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short interactive thriller story with choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices can impact outcomes and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 possible endings to conclude the trilogy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the events of 'Cold Verdict 2', but Claire did not waste any minute. Together with a small team of allies, she has been looking for the elusive masked man after his escape and devising a plan to stop him once and for all. After two years of search and planning, Claire has tracked him down. All that's left now is to bring him to justice. But to do that, Claire has to go through another one of his sick games - a race against time to stay alive. And along with her, two others are put through the exact same challenge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices during this ordeal will decide how things will shape up, whether you win trust, whether others survive, and whether this mission is a success. What kind of justice will you serve?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052180?t=1759404911","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052180/1e8278c5a151c0d23ccbdec9a4af3852766e934a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759404911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052180/ff766e81a0d3ac3125da497137080c015c10439c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759404911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052180/ff766e81a0d3ac3125da497137080c015c10439c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759404911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Crime, psychological thriller elements. Violence includes gun shots, explosions, and up close scuffles with body blows."},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final part in the 'Cold Verdict' trilogy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short interactive thriller story with choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices can impact outcomes and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 possible endings to conclude the trilogy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's been two years since the events of 'Cold Verdict 2', but Claire did not waste any minute. Together with a small team of allies, she has been looking for the elusive masked man after his escape and devising a plan to stop him once and for all. After two years of search and planning, Claire has tracked him down. All that's left now is to bring him to justice. But to do that, Claire has to go through another one of his sick games - a race against time to stay alive. And along with her, two others are put through the exact same challenge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices during this ordeal will decide how things will shape up, whether you win trust, whether others survive, and whether this mission is a success. What kind of justice will you serve?</p>","developers":["Astronomic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052180/313a2b7bdeb0da3958e69a925f05330045e9421b/header.jpg?t=1759404911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Cold Verdict 3","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Int